    "Top lane is where you spend 20 minutes fighting over 3 CS, only for your bot lane to flame you because their 0/10 ADC thinks you should’ve roamed more.",
    
    "Winning top lane feels amazing... until you TP into a 4v5 teamfight, die instantly, and realize the only thing you carried was the enemy’s morale.",
    
    "Being a top laner is like being a supporting actor in a movie. You can have the best performance of your life, but no one will notice because the bot lane drama stole the spotlight.",
    
    "The real horror of top lane isn’t the constant ganks or the endless wave management; it’s watching your hard-earned turret take-down get overshadowed by your bot lane’s 1-for-4 'hero play.'",
    
